    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$5\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "The cube has six equal square faces. Let each side have length $x$ metres.\n$$\\begin{align*}150 &= 6x^2\\\\x^2 &= 25\\\\x &= 5\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$",
